{
  "FormatVersion": 3,
  "Id": "69bd6cd3-85b2-4a6c-9184-ab25045a51aa"/*BoundingBoxPoints*/,
  "Description": "Computes the axis-aligned bounding box of the connected points and outputs it as a single point.\n\nThe resulting point is located at the center of the box and its Scale is set to the size of the box. Points with NaN positions are ignored.\n\nTo access the values on the CPU, use [ReadPointsFromGpu] with [GetPointDataFromList].\n\nSee also: [BoundPoints]",
  "SymbolTags": "1088",
